        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n4\n10 4 8 5\n9 7 6 6\n5 5 7 11\n2 1\n5\n12 44 32 12 32\n43 32 12 32 31\n34 12 43 23 41\n3 4",
        "output": "36\n203",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Choose A1=10,B2=7,A3=8A_1 = 10, B_2 = 7, A_3 = 8A1​=10,B2​=7,A3​=8 and C4=11C_4 = 11C4​=11, for a sum of 363636.\nTest case 222: Choose B1=43,A2=44,C3=43,B4=32,C5=41B_1 = 43, A_2 = 44, C_3 = 43, B_4 = 32, C_5 = 41B1​=43,A2​=44,C3​=43,B4​=32,C5​=41, for a sum of 203203203."
